#: ../../agents/codex.rst:309
msgid "Codex loaded the configuration at start."
msgstr "Codex 在启动时已加载配置。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:310
msgid "Use **Restart**, **Restart extension** or a new session."
msgstr "使用 **Restart**、**Restart extension**,或新开会话。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:311
msgid "A change inside the managed block is lost."
msgstr "托管块内的修改丢失。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:312
msgid "The next ``wire`` rewrites the block."
msgstr "下一次 ``wire`` 会重写该块。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:313
msgid ""
"Make the change outside the block, or write the entry by hand and remove "
"the block with ``unwire``."
msgstr "在块之外修改,或手工编写条目并用 ``unwire`` 移除该块。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:315
msgid "The tools show another identity than ``anet status``."
msgstr "工具显示的身份与 ``anet status`` 不一致。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:316
msgid ""
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` in the entry names another data directory, or "
"``CODEX_HOME`` differs between the shell and Codex."
msgstr "条目中的 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 指向另一个数据目录,或 shell 与 Codex 中的 ``CODEX_HOME`` 不同。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:318
msgid ""
"Run ``anet --id <name> agents wire codex``, and use the same "
"``CODEX_HOME`` in both places."
msgstr "运行 ``anet --id <name> agents wire codex``,并在两处使用相同的 ``CODEX_HOME``。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:320
msgid "The entry written in WSL is not found by the Windows application."
msgstr "在 WSL 中写入的条目未被 Windows 应用找到。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:321
msgid "The two read different configuration homes."
msgstr "两者读取不同的配置主目录。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:322
msgid "Open the file through the extension and write the entry there."
msgstr "通过扩展打开该文件,并在其中写入条目。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:324
msgid ""
"Further causes are grouped by reason code in "
":doc:`/howto/troubleshooting`; the codes are listed in :doc:`/reference"
"/reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"其他原因按原因码归类于 :doc:`/howto/troubleshooting`;原因码的完整列表见 :doc:`/reference"
"/reason-codes`。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:329
msgid "Removal"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:335
msgid ""
"The command removes the managed block from ``config.toml`` and the guide "
"from ``AGENTS.md``, keeps other tables and text, and copies each changed "
"file to a backup first. An entry named ``anet`` that ``wire`` did not "
"write is left unchanged. Manual removal deletes the table "
"``[mcp_servers.anet]`` and the guide between the lines ``anet:begin`` and"
" ``anet:end``. For an entry that was created with ``codex mcp add``, "
"``codex mcp remove anet`` is available in ``codex-cli 0.163.0``."
msgstr ""
"该命令移除 ``config.toml`` 中的托管块和 ``AGENTS.md`` "
"中的指引,保留其他表和文字,并先将每个被修改的文件复制为备份。名为 ``anet`` 但并非由 ``wire`` "
"写入的条目保持不变。手动移除时,删除 ``[mcp_servers.anet]`` 表以及 ``anet:begin`` 与 "
"``anet:end`` 两行之间的指引。对于用 ``codex mcp add`` 创建的条目,``codex-cli 0.163.0`` 提供"
" ``codex mcp remove anet``。"

